# Uninvited Guests (otherAreas 81): CoP The Savage current, not completed (the check's false side; its own flow: a GM's
# mission step after login overwrites the current mission, which the recorder refuses): Justinius no section: CoP 4-2's
# 130 (importantEvent: Progress on its first showing, Event after it). A second talk at Status 0: 130 again (a 570 at
# Progress would beat it there). CoP 4-2 at Status 2 (a GM, the mission var): Justinius 110 (progressEvent: the
# mission's container ranks first, so no 570 could show here).
lists TavnazianSafehold/Justinius/onTrigger TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/570
char zone=TavnazianSafehold pos=80.2,-34,70.5 job=WAR lvl=75
mission Cop TheSavage current
login
trigger Justinius                       # The Savage not completed: no section; 130 (Progress, its first showing)
finish
trigger Justinius                       # 130 again (now Event: nothing above it)
finish
charvar Mission[6][418]Status 2         # a GM
trigger Justinius                       # CoP 4-2's 110
finish                                  # the mission's finish (completed)
